  "description": "*\"Thank you for coming all the way here.\"\n\n\"Oh, it's nothing! We came here to get away and have fun, too.\"*\n\nEngaged to be married next spring, Yeonhee and Seonrin are a sweet couple of four years. Desperate for a relaxing escape from their daily routines, they travel to the breathtaking countryside town of Musan to visit Yeonhee's close friend, Yunji, and her husband. Enchanted by the town’s lush, peaceful nature, the two couples slip into a cozy rhythm of shared drinks and late-night laughter. However, as the boundaries between friendship and temptation subtly blur under the night sky, their innocent holiday turns into something far more dangerous. Surrounded by Musan's quiet beauty, the four of them embark on an irresistible path, sharing a \"secret, special time\" together that will forever change their relationships...\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
